  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "周君，你知道中国最受欢迎的男人是谁吗？商人向他求财，兄弟向他求义气。考生向他求运气，一个败走麦城的人，为什么赢了中国人？一千八百年，今天挑战一口气给你讲清楚。三界伏魔大帝神威远征天尊关圣帝君关公关二爷今年八月是关公诞辰一千八百六十六周年。关公咆下过关关，难过关关过朱君。我说说，你听听。在想当初后汉三国年间，自从桃园三结义以来，大爷姓刘，名备字玄德，家住大树楼桑。二弟姓关名，羽字云长，家住山西蒲州谢良县三弟姓张名飞字翼德，家住涿州范阳郡。后续四弟姓赵，名云字子龙，家住镇定府，常山县末战过胜后称为常胜将军。这关云长温九斩华雄，过五关斩六将，华容道义士曹好青龙偃月刀，赤兔马，红脸绿袍。在博马坡斩颜良诛文丑之时，百万军中能取上将之首级，如探囊取物，反掌，官文一般率部北伐。他借连日暴雨的天时，水淹于尽，欺军生擒三万曹军，一度逼得曹操商议，迁都避其锋芒。从古至今，威震华夏者，唯有关云长一人而已。你知道吗？中国神仙那么多，但没有谁能像关公如佛道斯三教，并尊士农工商四名同伴儒家，尊他为武圣人和文圣人。孔子并列还被考生奉为文衡帝君，佛家封他为护法神奇兰菩萨、道家，把他奉为档魔除妖的关胜帝君。这一千八百多年间，十六位皇帝二十三次给他加封，从侯公王到大帝，最长封号打二十六个字。这一切都源于一个字义字。帝王看中他风金挂印千里寻凶的忠义百姓，需要他不求同年同日生，但求同年同月同日死的抱团情谊。商人敬重他，华容道义，是曹操报恩的信义。黑道拜他讲义气，白道敬他守诚信，老百姓不愿指拜那些高高在上的神明。大家发自内心的偏爱关二爷，感念他重情重义，体恤凡人，把他视作自家可靠的亲人一般，他永远是那位重守信诺，有血有肉的关二爷。你知道关公有多牛吗？全世界一百六十八个国家和地区有超过三万座关帝庙。从美国纽约、旧金山到神户、横滨、新加坡、曼谷等地关帝庙宇神龛随处可见，早年大批的华人下南洋，远赴美洲谋生，行囊，里面总会带上关公神像与牌位。北美的旧金山、纽约唐人街的商铺，家家供奉关公海外华人经商。一旦遇到纠纷，就会请出关公牌位。怪不得说凡有华人处，必有关公。在朱军，您看关羽头枕洛阳，身卧当阳，魂归故里，破阵，荆州位尊帝王庙。这是全世界最早的关帝庙。洛阳关林世界上最著名的两个陵，一个是孔圣人的曲服孔林，另外一个就是关圣人的洛阳关陵。你看这关公坟头上的树，只要长到五十八年，这些树不是枯死，就是被雷劈死。五十八岁，武圣人无头草木又岂敢冒头。而且关羽人墓一千多年以来，从来没有被盗过木门上的两个小孔，左求平安，右求富贵，老百姓塞个铜板进去。当当当一声响就表示，官老爷听见了朱金，您知道这洛阳关林是谁安排建设的吗？曹操以诸侯之礼厚葬关公，这曹操才是关羽最有分量的人格认证人。因为真正的人格，不只是让朋友追随，也会让对手敬重他，不负旧义，也不欠新恩。每一份情奋都有交代。在中国古代，县县有文庙，村村有武庙，你敢信吗？仅在山西运城一地，就有大约两百座关帝庙。这是湖北当阳关陵埋葬着关羽的身躯，一部荆州城，半部三国史，被誉为天下第一关羽子。你看，这是世界上规模最大、保存最完整的关帝庙。始建于隋代，距今已有一千四百多年的历史，被誉为官庙之祖。它就是关于老家山西运城的谢州。关帝庙，身长九尺，美人弓面如虫，藻唇若图纸。丹凤眼卧蚕眉，相貌堂堂，威风凛凛，品读春秋。这是全世界最大最重的关公铜像，相当于二十多层楼的高度，比美国的自由女神像还要高。十五米人站在他的脚下，甚至还没有他的脚趾高。俗话说得好，关公脚下走一走，幸福长长又久久，朱晶关公明明是武将，但为什么说他是财神呢？仔细观察您会发现公司的前台，街边的小店，甚至有一些搓澡的地方都供奉着。关二爷，这是为什么呢？原来，关公的老乡晋商走南闯北，做生意就到处修建关公会馆和关帝庙。因为生意做到最后拼的从来不只是算盘，而是信用。关公不是来教你怎么赚快钱的，而是在财的面前给你立一条规矩。利可以求义，不能丢钱可以赚，承诺不能破。每次涉火表演，关公的家候，都会有很多带着孩子叩拜的家长。关二爷手舞青龙偃月春秋刀，斩除，世间所有的不公。如果科学解释不了，那信仰就是最后的防线。而你能想象吗？关羽竟然还是世界警察之父，关二爷曾经担任过别部司马，相当于现在的警察。你看香港很多警察局都有关羽的，像特警队的警徽，就是关老爷，拿一把刀。旧金山有一个执法联盟的警徽，一看也是关老爷。而如今，在英国、加拿大、澳洲等地的华人警局，都会摆放着关公塑像，警员拜关公，时刻提醒自己，终于于国家忠于人民，你知道吗？关二爷可不是谁都能演的。关公戏在梨园行里规矩极多，扮演者全程都要心怀敬畏，第一，扮相要破脸，脸谱上要点痣，画细差，不能画完整无缺的关公脸，寓意演员只是模仿，扮演并非真身，以示恭敬。早年老规矩，甚至要点七颗破相痣。第二，办戏前后有斋戒，晋身，讲究。旧时候，演员上台前需要沐浴斋戒，后台设香案，祭拜关公，勾脸穿戴行头的时候，不能随意说笑、喧哗。第三，带好染口完整拌上之后不可以随意和人搭话，直视旁人登台亮相，也有专属的四十八式关公身段，不能乱做姿态，还有青龙偃月刀属于神械，后台，不能随意把玩磕碰。这些老规矩就是梨元航前辈对忠义武圣的敬重。朱军啊朱军，您看这关羽，从汉寿亭侯到关胜大帝，千百年来，一个败军之将却配享官庙，被尊为武圣与文圣齐名。只因为中国人相信成败不足以论英雄，他没有守住荆州，却替中国人守住了一个义字。我们中国人真正的英雄关，从来不是谁赢了，我就崇拜谁，而是你在输赢之外守住了什么。关羽败走麦城，没有完成匡扶汉室的大业。诸葛亮六出祁山并是五丈原北伐失败。岳飞败志未酬。十二道金牌之后死于风波亭。文天祥强兵败被俘，南宋也没有获救。项羽乌江自刎，连天下都是刘邦的，可中国人偏偏记住了，他们事情可以没做成，人不能垮，江山可以失去气节，不能丢。世界上很多东西都可以靠努力争取成独，遇到一个有情有义的人，需要运气成是能力，而败是命气。但在成败之间，如何守住人格，这就是英雄。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 610,
      "end_ms": 1010,
      "text": "周君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1450,
      "end_ms": 4170,
      "text": "你知道中国最受欢迎的男人是谁吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4410,
      "end_ms": 5790,
      "text": "商人向他求财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 7470,
      "text": "兄弟向他求义气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7590,
      "end_ms": 9190,
      "text": "考生向他求运气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9630,
      "end_ms": 11310,
      "text": "一个败走麦城的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11310,
      "end_ms": 12410,
      "text": "为什么赢了中国人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12410,
      "end_ms": 13330,
      "text": "一千八百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13630,
      "end_ms": 15590,
      "text": "今天挑战一口气给你讲清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15810,
      "end_ms": 25170,
      "text": "三界伏魔大帝神威远征天尊关圣帝君关公关二爷今年八月是关公诞辰一千八百六十六周年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25530,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "关公咆下过关关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27330,
      "end_ms": 29490,
      "text": "难过关关过朱君。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29690,
      "end_ms": 30295,
      "text": "我说说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30580,
      "end_ms": 31320,
      "text": "你听听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 31440,
      "end_ms": 34120,
      "text": "在想当初后汉三国年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34240,
      "end_ms": 36040,
      "text": "自从桃园三结义以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36180,
      "end_ms": 37200,
      "text": "大爷姓刘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37200,
      "end_ms": 38200,
      "text": "名备字玄德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38260,
      "end_ms": 39560,
      "text": "家住大树楼桑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39780,
      "end_ms": 41060,
      "text": "二弟姓关名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 41060,
      "end_ms": 41780,
      "text": "羽字云长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41940,
      "end_ms": 46120,
      "text": "家住山西蒲州谢良县三弟姓张名飞字翼德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 46120,
      "end_ms": 47580,
      "text": "家住涿州范阳郡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47820,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "后续四弟姓赵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49220,
      "end_ms": 50100,
      "text": "名云字子龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50100,
      "end_ms": 51060,
      "text": "家住镇定府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 51120,
      "end_ms": 54640,
      "text": "常山县末战过胜后称为常胜将军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 55020,
      "end_ms": 57160,
      "text": "这关云长温九斩华雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 57340,
      "end_ms": 58780,
      "text": "过五关斩六将，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 58940,
      "end_ms": 61830,
      "text": "华容道义士曹好青龙偃月刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 61830,
      "end_ms": 62450,
      "text": "赤兔马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 62510,
      "end_ms": 63475,
      "text": "红脸绿袍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63790,
      "end_ms": 66090,
      "text": "在博马坡斩颜良诛文丑之时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 66250,
      "end_ms": 68590,
      "text": "百万军中能取上将之首级，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 68670,
      "end_ms": 69830,
      "text": "如探囊取物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 69950,
      "end_ms": 70490,
      "text": "反掌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 70630,
      "end_ms": 72590,
      "text": "官文一般率部北伐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 72690,
      "end_ms": 74430,
      "text": "他借连日暴雨的天时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 74590,
      "end_ms": 75510,
      "text": "水淹于尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 75530,
      "end_ms": 77470,
      "text": "欺军生擒三万曹军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77630,
      "end_ms": 78930,
      "text": "一度逼得曹操商议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 78930,
      "end_ms": 80235,
      "text": "迁都避其锋芒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 80510,
      "end_ms": 81250,
      "text": "从古至今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 81350,
      "end_ms": 82470,
      "text": "威震华夏者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 82470,
      "end_ms": 84485,
      "text": "唯有关云长一人而已。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 84810,
      "end_ms": 85410,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 85410,
      "end_ms": 86790,
      "text": "中国神仙那么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 86850,
      "end_ms": 90640,
      "text": "但没有谁能像关公如佛道斯三教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 90700,
      "end_ms": 94090,
      "text": "并尊士农工商四名同伴儒家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 94090,
      "end_ms": 96010,
      "text": "尊他为武圣人和文圣人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 96010,
      "end_ms": 99245,
      "text": "孔子并列还被考生奉为文衡帝君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 99630,
      "end_ms": 102720,
      "text": "佛家封他为护法神奇兰菩萨、道家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 102720,
      "end_ms": 105465,
      "text": "把他奉为档魔除妖的关胜帝君。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 105800,
      "end_ms": 107160,
      "text": "这一千八百多年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 107160,
      "end_ms": 109525,
      "text": "十六位皇帝二十三次给他加封，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 109870,
      "end_ms": 112050,
      "text": "从侯公王到大帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 112150,
      "end_ms": 113845,
      "text": "最长封号打二十六个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 114120,
      "end_ms": 116345,
      "text": "这一切都源于一个字义字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 116750,
      "end_ms": 120640,
      "text": "帝王看中他风金挂印千里寻凶的忠义百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 120660,
      "end_ms": 122360,
      "text": "需要他不求同年同日生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 122480,
      "end_ms": 125405,
      "text": "但求同年同月同日死的抱团情谊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 125760,
      "end_ms": 126700,
      "text": "商人敬重他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 126700,
      "end_ms": 127420,
      "text": "华容道义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 127420,
      "end_ms": 129020,
      "text": "是曹操报恩的信义。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 129160,
      "end_ms": 130640,
      "text": "黑道拜他讲义气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 130820,
      "end_ms": 132595,
      "text": "白道敬他守诚信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 133080,
      "end_ms": 135740,
      "text": "老百姓不愿指拜那些高高在上的神明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 135760,
      "end_ms": 138325,
      "text": "大家发自内心的偏爱关二爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 138690,
      "end_ms": 140290,
      "text": "感念他重情重义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 140330,
      "end_ms": 141190,
      "text": "体恤凡人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 141270,
      "end_ms": 143485,
      "text": "把他视作自家可靠的亲人一般，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 143700,
      "end_ms": 145800,
      "text": "他永远是那位重守信诺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 145940,
      "end_ms": 147785,
      "text": "有血有肉的关二爷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 148120,
      "end_ms": 149760,
      "text": "你知道关公有多牛吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 149900,
      "end_ms": 154555,
      "text": "全世界一百六十八个国家和地区有超过三万座关帝庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 154950,
      "end_ms": 160875,
      "text": "从美国纽约、旧金山到神户、横滨、新加坡、曼谷等地关帝庙宇神龛随处可见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 161370,
      "end_ms": 163110,
      "text": "早年大批的华人下南洋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 163130,
      "end_ms": 164310,
      "text": "远赴美洲谋生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 164490,
      "end_ms": 164910,
      "text": "行囊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 164910,
      "end_ms": 167535,
      "text": "里面总会带上关公神像与牌位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 167990,
      "end_ms": 170370,
      "text": "北美的旧金山、纽约唐人街的商铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 170430,
      "end_ms": 173120,
      "text": "家家供奉关公海外华人经商。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 173140,
      "end_ms": 174120,
      "text": "一旦遇到纠纷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 174160,
      "end_ms": 175805,
      "text": "就会请出关公牌位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 176120,
      "end_ms": 177920,
      "text": "怪不得说凡有华人处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 177960,
      "end_ms": 178860,
      "text": "必有关公。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 178860,
      "end_ms": 179980,
      "text": "在朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 179980,
      "end_ms": 181740,
      "text": "您看关羽头枕洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 181800,
      "end_ms": 182700,
      "text": "身卧当阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 182800,
      "end_ms": 183640,
      "text": "魂归故里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 183740,
      "end_ms": 184240,
      "text": "破阵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 184260,
      "end_ms": 185925,
      "text": "荆州位尊帝王庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 186250,
      "end_ms": 188170,
      "text": "这是全世界最早的关帝庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 188310,
      "end_ms": 191660,
      "text": "洛阳关林世界上最著名的两个陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 191660,
      "end_ms": 193780,
      "text": "一个是孔圣人的曲服孔林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 193920,
      "end_ms": 196485,
      "text": "另外一个就是关圣人的洛阳关陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 196840,
      "end_ms": 198480,
      "text": "你看这关公坟头上的树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 198540,
      "end_ms": 200020,
      "text": "只要长到五十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 200100,
      "end_ms": 201440,
      "text": "这些树不是枯死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 201460,
      "end_ms": 202515,
      "text": "就是被雷劈死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 202860,
      "end_ms": 203700,
      "text": "五十八岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 203880,
      "end_ms": 206724,
      "text": "武圣人无头草木又岂敢冒头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 206990,
      "end_ms": 209070,
      "text": "而且关羽人墓一千多年以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 209070,
      "end_ms": 211820,
      "text": "从来没有被盗过木门上的两个小孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 211960,
      "end_ms": 212940,
      "text": "左求平安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 212980,
      "end_ms": 213905,
      "text": "右求富贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 214150,
      "end_ms": 215610,
      "text": "老百姓塞个铜板进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 215750,
      "end_ms": 217390,
      "text": "当当当一声响就表示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 217450,
      "end_ms": 219370,
      "text": "官老爷听见了朱金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 219710,
      "end_ms": 222685,
      "text": "您知道这洛阳关林是谁安排建设的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 223050,
      "end_ms": 226065,
      "text": "曹操以诸侯之礼厚葬关公，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 226410,
      "end_ms": 229905,
      "text": "这曹操才是关羽最有分量的人格认证人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 230290,
      "end_ms": 231290,
      "text": "因为真正的人格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 231290,
      "end_ms": 232690,
      "text": "不只是让朋友追随，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 232830,
      "end_ms": 234610,
      "text": "也会让对手敬重他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 234610,
      "end_ms": 235470,
      "text": "不负旧义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 235610,
      "end_ms": 236695,
      "text": "也不欠新恩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 236980,
      "end_ms": 239015,
      "text": "每一份情奋都有交代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 239350,
      "end_ms": 240210,
      "text": "在中国古代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 240370,
      "end_ms": 241570,
      "text": "县县有文庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 241770,
      "end_ms": 243015,
      "text": "村村有武庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 243290,
      "end_ms": 243825,
      "text": "你敢信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 244070,
      "end_ms": 245630,
      "text": "仅在山西运城一地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 245690,
      "end_ms": 247775,
      "text": "就有大约两百座关帝庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00125",
      "start_ms": 248230,
      "end_ms": 251150,
      "text": "这是湖北当阳关陵埋葬着关羽的身躯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00126",
      "start_ms": 251430,
      "end_ms": 252630,
      "text": "一部荆州城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00127",
      "start_ms": 252750,
      "end_ms": 253830,
      "text": "半部三国史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00128",
      "start_ms": 253830,
      "end_ms": 255605,
      "text": "被誉为天下第一关羽子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00129",
      "start_ms": 255940,
      "end_ms": 256260,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00130",
      "start_ms": 256460,
      "end_ms": 259660,
      "text": "这是世界上规模最大、保存最完整的关帝庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00131",
      "start_ms": 259840,
      "end_ms": 260960,
      "text": "始建于隋代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00132",
      "start_ms": 261060,
      "end_ms": 262920,
      "text": "距今已有一千四百多年的历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00133",
      "start_ms": 262940,
      "end_ms": 264415,
      "text": "被誉为官庙之祖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00134",
      "start_ms": 264690,
      "end_ms": 267510,
      "text": "它就是关于老家山西运城的谢州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00135",
      "start_ms": 267570,
      "end_ms": 268165,
      "text": "关帝庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00136",
      "start_ms": 268480,
      "end_ms": 269460,
      "text": "身长九尺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00137",
      "start_ms": 269460,
      "end_ms": 270960,
      "text": "美人弓面如虫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00138",
      "start_ms": 270980,
      "end_ms": 272305,
      "text": "藻唇若图纸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00139",
      "start_ms": 272600,
      "end_ms": 273880,
      "text": "丹凤眼卧蚕眉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00140",
      "start_ms": 273960,
      "end_ms": 274820,
      "text": "相貌堂堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00141",
      "start_ms": 274840,
      "end_ms": 275635,
      "text": "威风凛凛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00142",
      "start_ms": 275880,
      "end_ms": 276915,
      "text": "品读春秋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00143",
      "start_ms": 277390,
      "end_ms": 279990,
      "text": "这是全世界最大最重的关公铜像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00144",
      "start_ms": 280170,
      "end_ms": 282070,
      "text": "相当于二十多层楼的高度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00145",
      "start_ms": 282150,
      "end_ms": 284150,
      "text": "比美国的自由女神像还要高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00146",
      "start_ms": 284170,
      "end_ms": 286270,
      "text": "十五米人站在他的脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00147",
      "start_ms": 286270,
      "end_ms": 287965,
      "text": "甚至还没有他的脚趾高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00148",
      "start_ms": 288360,
      "end_ms": 289180,
      "text": "俗话说得好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00149",
      "start_ms": 289280,
      "end_ms": 290860,
      "text": "关公脚下走一走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00150",
      "start_ms": 291040,
      "end_ms": 293025,
      "text": "幸福长长又久久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00151",
      "start_ms": 293610,
      "end_ms": 295840,
      "text": "朱晶关公明明是武将，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00152",
      "start_ms": 295980,
      "end_ms": 297865,
      "text": "但为什么说他是财神呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00153",
      "start_ms": 298210,
      "end_ms": 300610,
      "text": "仔细观察您会发现公司的前台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00154",
      "start_ms": 300650,
      "end_ms": 301550,
      "text": "街边的小店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00155",
      "start_ms": 301690,
      "end_ms": 303775,
      "text": "甚至有一些搓澡的地方都供奉着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00156",
      "start_ms": 304010,
      "end_ms": 304610,
      "text": "关二爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00157",
      "start_ms": 304770,
      "end_ms": 305730,
      "text": "这是为什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00158",
      "start_ms": 305970,
      "end_ms": 306390,
      "text": "原来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00159",
      "start_ms": 306430,
      "end_ms": 308550,
      "text": "关公的老乡晋商走南闯北，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00160",
      "start_ms": 308550,
      "end_ms": 311550,
      "text": "做生意就到处修建关公会馆和关帝庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00161",
      "start_ms": 311750,
      "end_ms": 314370,
      "text": "因为生意做到最后拼的从来不只是算盘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00162",
      "start_ms": 314370,
      "end_ms": 315550,
      "text": "而是信用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00163",
      "start_ms": 315970,
      "end_ms": 318010,
      "text": "关公不是来教你怎么赚快钱的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00164",
      "start_ms": 318030,
      "end_ms": 320270,
      "text": "而是在财的面前给你立一条规矩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00165",
      "start_ms": 320530,
      "end_ms": 321950,
      "text": "利可以求义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00166",
      "start_ms": 322030,
      "end_ms": 323690,
      "text": "不能丢钱可以赚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00167",
      "start_ms": 323810,
      "end_ms": 324950,
      "text": "承诺不能破。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00168",
      "start_ms": 325350,
      "end_ms": 326450,
      "text": "每次涉火表演，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00169",
      "start_ms": 326450,
      "end_ms": 327150,
      "text": "关公的家候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00170",
      "start_ms": 327150,
      "end_ms": 329310,
      "text": "都会有很多带着孩子叩拜的家长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00171",
      "start_ms": 329530,
      "end_ms": 331890,
      "text": "关二爷手舞青龙偃月春秋刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00172",
      "start_ms": 332010,
      "end_ms": 332490,
      "text": "斩除，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00173",
      "start_ms": 332530,
      "end_ms": 333805,
      "text": "世间所有的不公。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00174",
      "start_ms": 334320,
      "end_ms": 335640,
      "text": "如果科学解释不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00175",
      "start_ms": 335640,
      "end_ms": 337420,
      "text": "那信仰就是最后的防线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00176",
      "start_ms": 337880,
      "end_ms": 338860,
      "text": "而你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00177",
      "start_ms": 338960,
      "end_ms": 341380,
      "text": "关羽竟然还是世界警察之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00178",
      "start_ms": 341660,
      "end_ms": 343940,
      "text": "关二爷曾经担任过别部司马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00179",
      "start_ms": 344000,
      "end_ms": 345260,
      "text": "相当于现在的警察。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00180",
      "start_ms": 345340,
      "end_ms": 348200,
      "text": "你看香港很多警察局都有关羽的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00181",
      "start_ms": 348200,
      "end_ms": 349860,
      "text": "像特警队的警徽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00182",
      "start_ms": 349940,
      "end_ms": 350820,
      "text": "就是关老爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00183",
      "start_ms": 350820,
      "end_ms": 351480,
      "text": "拿一把刀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00184",
      "start_ms": 352020,
      "end_ms": 354020,
      "text": "旧金山有一个执法联盟的警徽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00185",
      "start_ms": 354020,
      "end_ms": 355320,
      "text": "一看也是关老爷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00186",
      "start_ms": 355400,
      "end_ms": 355920,
      "text": "而如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00187",
      "start_ms": 355920,
      "end_ms": 358660,
      "text": "在英国、加拿大、澳洲等地的华人警局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00188",
      "start_ms": 358800,
      "end_ms": 360580,
      "text": "都会摆放着关公塑像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00189",
      "start_ms": 360980,
      "end_ms": 362200,
      "text": "警员拜关公，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00190",
      "start_ms": 362380,
      "end_ms": 363400,
      "text": "时刻提醒自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00191",
      "start_ms": 363520,
      "end_ms": 365355,
      "text": "终于于国家忠于人民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00192",
      "start_ms": 365900,
      "end_ms": 366540,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00193",
      "start_ms": 366540,
      "end_ms": 368725,
      "text": "关二爷可不是谁都能演的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00194",
      "start_ms": 369170,
      "end_ms": 371465,
      "text": "关公戏在梨园行里规矩极多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00195",
      "start_ms": 371750,
      "end_ms": 373490,
      "text": "扮演者全程都要心怀敬畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00196",
      "start_ms": 373570,
      "end_ms": 373910,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00197",
      "start_ms": 373910,
      "end_ms": 375085,
      "text": "扮相要破脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00198",
      "start_ms": 375560,
      "end_ms": 376700,
      "text": "脸谱上要点痣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00199",
      "start_ms": 376780,
      "end_ms": 377480,
      "text": "画细差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00200",
      "start_ms": 377560,
      "end_ms": 379440,
      "text": "不能画完整无缺的关公脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00201",
      "start_ms": 379480,
      "end_ms": 380980,
      "text": "寓意演员只是模仿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00202",
      "start_ms": 381020,
      "end_ms": 382460,
      "text": "扮演并非真身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00203",
      "start_ms": 382500,
      "end_ms": 383235,
      "text": "以示恭敬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00204",
      "start_ms": 383610,
      "end_ms": 384430,
      "text": "早年老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00205",
      "start_ms": 384430,
      "end_ms": 386345,
      "text": "甚至要点七颗破相痣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00206",
      "start_ms": 386610,
      "end_ms": 387035,
      "text": "第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00207",
      "start_ms": 387190,
      "end_ms": 388810,
      "text": "办戏前后有斋戒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00208",
      "start_ms": 388830,
      "end_ms": 389230,
      "text": "晋身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00209",
      "start_ms": 389230,
      "end_ms": 389625,
      "text": "讲究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00210",
      "start_ms": 389910,
      "end_ms": 390370,
      "text": "旧时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00211",
      "start_ms": 390370,
      "end_ms": 392285,
      "text": "演员上台前需要沐浴斋戒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00212",
      "start_ms": 392560,
      "end_ms": 393620,
      "text": "后台设香案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00213",
      "start_ms": 393660,
      "end_ms": 394440,
      "text": "祭拜关公，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00214",
      "start_ms": 394660,
      "end_ms": 396180,
      "text": "勾脸穿戴行头的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00215",
      "start_ms": 396180,
      "end_ms": 397905,
      "text": "不能随意说笑、喧哗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00216",
      "start_ms": 398170,
      "end_ms": 398545,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00217",
      "start_ms": 398810,
      "end_ms": 401965,
      "text": "带好染口完整拌上之后不可以随意和人搭话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00218",
      "start_ms": 402230,
      "end_ms": 403990,
      "text": "直视旁人登台亮相，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00219",
      "start_ms": 403990,
      "end_ms": 406150,
      "text": "也有专属的四十八式关公身段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00220",
      "start_ms": 406150,
      "end_ms": 407250,
      "text": "不能乱做姿态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00221",
      "start_ms": 407450,
      "end_ms": 409330,
      "text": "还有青龙偃月刀属于神械，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00222",
      "start_ms": 409490,
      "end_ms": 409830,
      "text": "后台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00223",
      "start_ms": 409830,
      "end_ms": 411335,
      "text": "不能随意把玩磕碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00224",
      "start_ms": 411650,
      "end_ms": 415905,
      "text": "这些老规矩就是梨元航前辈对忠义武圣的敬重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00225",
      "start_ms": 416580,
      "end_ms": 417440,
      "text": "朱军啊朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00226",
      "start_ms": 417700,
      "end_ms": 418680,
      "text": "您看这关羽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00227",
      "start_ms": 418820,
      "end_ms": 421180,
      "text": "从汉寿亭侯到关胜大帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00228",
      "start_ms": 421300,
      "end_ms": 422120,
      "text": "千百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00229",
      "start_ms": 422280,
      "end_ms": 425010,
      "text": "一个败军之将却配享官庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00230",
      "start_ms": 425110,
      "end_ms": 427570,
      "text": "被尊为武圣与文圣齐名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00231",
      "start_ms": 427810,
      "end_ms": 431050,
      "text": "只因为中国人相信成败不足以论英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00232",
      "start_ms": 431390,
      "end_ms": 432610,
      "text": "他没有守住荆州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00233",
      "start_ms": 432790,
      "end_ms": 434750,
      "text": "却替中国人守住了一个义字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00234",
      "start_ms": 434990,
      "end_ms": 436770,
      "text": "我们中国人真正的英雄关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00235",
      "start_ms": 436770,
      "end_ms": 438230,
      "text": "从来不是谁赢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00236",
      "start_ms": 438230,
      "end_ms": 438990,
      "text": "我就崇拜谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00237",
      "start_ms": 439130,
      "end_ms": 442230,
      "text": "而是你在输赢之外守住了什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00238",
      "start_ms": 442590,
      "end_ms": 443910,
      "text": "关羽败走麦城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00239",
      "start_ms": 443930,
      "end_ms": 445710,
      "text": "没有完成匡扶汉室的大业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00240",
      "start_ms": 445870,
      "end_ms": 449290,
      "text": "诸葛亮六出祁山并是五丈原北伐失败。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00241",
      "start_ms": 449450,
      "end_ms": 450870,
      "text": "岳飞败志未酬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00242",
      "start_ms": 450870,
      "end_ms": 452890,
      "text": "十二道金牌之后死于风波亭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00243",
      "start_ms": 453250,
      "end_ms": 454960,
      "text": "文天祥强兵败被俘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00244",
      "start_ms": 455040,
      "end_ms": 456260,
      "text": "南宋也没有获救。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00245",
      "start_ms": 456580,
      "end_ms": 457940,
      "text": "项羽乌江自刎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00246",
      "start_ms": 458040,
      "end_ms": 459800,
      "text": "连天下都是刘邦的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00247",
      "start_ms": 460020,
      "end_ms": 461820,
      "text": "可中国人偏偏记住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00248",
      "start_ms": 461820,
      "end_ms": 463860,
      "text": "他们事情可以没做成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00249",
      "start_ms": 464120,
      "end_ms": 464940,
      "text": "人不能垮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00250",
      "start_ms": 465220,
      "end_ms": 467300,
      "text": "江山可以失去气节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00251",
      "start_ms": 467300,
      "end_ms": 467820,
      "text": "不能丢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00252",
      "start_ms": 468320,
      "end_ms": 471520,
      "text": "世界上很多东西都可以靠努力争取成独，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00253",
      "start_ms": 471620,
      "end_ms": 473920,
      "text": "遇到一个有情有义的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00254",
      "start_ms": 474060,
      "end_ms": 476660,
      "text": "需要运气成是能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00255",
      "start_ms": 476840,
      "end_ms": 478400,
      "text": "而败是命气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00256",
      "start_ms": 478700,
      "end_ms": 480020,
      "text": "但在成败之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00257",
      "start_ms": 480260,
      "end_ms": 481700,
      "text": "如何守住人格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_06cb6232b96b1c9c_s00258",
      "start_ms": 481940,
      "end_ms": 483525,
      "text": "这就是英雄。"
    }
  ],
